  "solution": "$$\\frac{1}{2}kx^2 = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x = v\\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k}} = 4\\sqrt{\\frac{0.5}{200}} = 4 \\times 0.05 = 0.2\\ \\text{m}$$",
